<li><a href="/wiki/Hippocratic_Oath" title="Hippocratic Oath">Hippocratic Oath</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/IEEE" class="mw-redirect" title="IEEE">IEEE</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Iron_Ring" title="Iron Ring">Iron Ring</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/List_of_engineering_awards" title="List of engineering awards">List of engineering awards</a></li>
